<%--
External_Link - Link to external website with globe icon

Displays a clickable link to an external website with a globe icon.
Automatically converts short URLs (domain.com) to full URLs (http://domain.com).

$href - The URL to link to (can be with or without protocol)
$label - Optional label text to display (defaults to short URL)

Usage:
<External_Link $href="acmegroup.com" />
<External_Link $href="https://example.com" $label="Visit Example" />
--%>
<Define:External_Link tag="a" target="_blank">
    <i class="bi bi-globe"></i> <%= this.args.label || full_url_to_short_url(this.args.href) %>
</Define:External_Link>
